576400240", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619718_2937875579733573_1296162545248688338_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ojQ06XX9vIQ7kNvwGVSjUN&_nc_oc=AdprZaOAvhhx0mUTsOPiWoLco1bi-Rj1KF3Ypl1J2JZK9ubnPPytItPLJL3oR1Hc6sI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLhGBDEGym_aghk-zs76Opd0Pc2mNlqgeXa7eZ1M9Wu7A&oe=6AA01F8F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Slippery Slide -  Water Park Adventure", "keywords": ["WaterSlide", "WaterPark", "WaterGame", "AdventureGame", "FunGame"], "long_description": "Welcome to Slippery Slide VR  the ultimate VR water slide adventure!\n\nFeel the rush as you launch down twisting tubes, loop through sky-high slides, and splash into crazy splash zones\u2014all from the comfort of your headset.\nWhether you're sliding through neon tunnels, racing through tropical islands, or defying gravity in fantasy realms, each level offers a new, exhilarating ride. Designed for all ages, Slippery Slide VR brings the excitement of a water park straight into virtual reality.\n\n\ud83c\udfa2 Features:\n\u2022 Hyper-immersive sliding physics\n\u2022 Multiple slide environments (jungle, city, fantasy & more)\n\u2022 Thrilling speeds and stunts\n\u2022 Smooth VR navigation \u2013 sit, slide, and scream!\n\u2022 Perfect for family fun, casual gamers, and VR arcades\nSo grab your headset, hold on tight, and get ready to scream, laugh, and splash in Slippery Slide VR!", "short_description": "Dive into the thrill!\nSlippery Slide VR lets you zoom, splash, and twist through wild water slides in a fully immersive virtual world. Fun, fast, and full of surprises this is water park madness like never before!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tul